(499563, 48903, 327, '<td valign="top">I can really feel the vastness of the ocean looking at this shot. Good perspective and the near ground with the birds is an excellent touch. I think some adjustment of saturation would of increase the ''wow'' of this shot to really enhance the sky. All in all I think this is good and should do well. 7</td>', 'I can really feel the vastness of the ocean looking at this shot. Good perspective and the near ground with the birds is an excellent touch. I think some adjustment of saturation would of increase the ''wow'' of this shot to really enhance the sky. All in all I think this is good and should do well. 7', '2003-12-01 00:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
