(499760, 48909, 2553, '<td valign="top">Quite a lovely shot, this has a wonderful ethereal feel to it that I just love.  The "framing", (crop), feels a little bit off to me; a somewhat unbalanced feel.  It has a much stronger "feel" to me  with the tree on the far left cropped out.</td>', 'Quite a lovely shot, this has a wonderful ethereal feel to it that I just love.  The "framing", (crop), feels a little bit off to me; a somewhat unbalanced feel.  It has a much stronger "feel" to me  with the tree on the far left cropped out.', '2003-12-01 06:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
