(499762, 49090, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this.  For me it has an interesting composition, and the feel of mystery.  It makes you want to know more.  Also, if you look at it carefully, the pier with it''s very strong shadow can look like a huge steel I-beam projecting out into nothingness, which creates a very odd feel of suspense.  Hmm.. I''m going to have to come back to this and spend more time on it, but for now-9</td>', 'I like this.  For me it has an interesting composition, and the feel of mystery.  It makes you want to know more.  Also, if you look at it carefully, the pier with it''s very strong shadow can look like a huge steel I-beam projecting out into nothingness, which creates a very odd feel of suspense.  Hmm.. I''m going to have to come back to this and spend more time on it, but for now-9', '2003-12-01 06:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(499764, 48803, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - looks like an early morning shot, and you''ve captured it well.  Love the glow it has.</td>', 'Beautiful - looks like an early morning shot, and you''ve captured it well.  Love the glow it has.', '2003-12-01 06:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
