(499769, 49089, 13749, '<td valign="top">beautiful dog and tones.  with this composition, it''s one of my favorites in this challenge - the empty space on the right gives the dog room to gaze into, and the soft focus provides a "dreamy" effect that''s very suitable for this shot.  creative.</td>', 'beautiful dog and tones.  with this composition, it''s one of my favorites in this challenge - the empty space on the right gives the dog room to gaze into, and the soft focus provides a "dreamy" effect that''s very suitable for this shot.  creative.', '2003-12-01 06:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
