(499881, 48894, 2634, '<td valign="top">Very pretty still life. I love the composition here. Would like a little more light on the pitcher, but thats me. You did a super job on the softness...very artistic.</td>', 'Very pretty still life. I love the composition here. Would like a little more light on the pitcher, but thats me. You did a super job on the softness...very artistic.', '2003-12-01 09:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(499897, 49123, 7466, '<td valign="top">I like the rose...love flower shots in general...but there is just something unappealing about the color of the background...perhaps the white balance was off?</td>', 'I like the rose...love flower shots in general...but there is just something unappealing about the color of the background...perhaps the white balance was off?', '2003-12-01 09:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(499900, 49106, 8860, '<td valign="top">The space in this shot could have been enhanced with an off-centre composition that would increase the perception of isolation of the subjects. I really like it, but as a design it is just too central.<br/> <br/>However, it''s beautifully lit, well shot, crisp and a welcome respite to the filter brigade.</td>', 'The space in this shot could have been enhanced with an off-centre composition that would increase the perception of isolation of the subjects. I really like it, but as a design it is just too central. However, it''s beautifully lit, well shot, crisp and a welcome respite to the filter brigade.', '2003-12-01 09:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(499908, 49076, 8860, '<td valign="top">Overall this is a pleasant shot of what must have been quite dramatic lighting. I do think it looks a bit washed out and there is little in the shot to hold interest for long, other than the sunrays. <br/> <br/>It''s my kind of soft focus though, so well done for avoiding the net curtains or vaseline!</td>', 'Overall this is a pleasant shot of what must have been quite dramatic lighting. I do think it looks a bit washed out and there is little in the shot to hold interest for long, other than the sunrays.  It''s my kind of soft focus though, so well done for avoiding the net curtains or vaseline!', '2003-12-01 09:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(499911, 49193, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition, but the DOF is a bit too narrow. I find it a bit taxing focally.<br/> <br/>Had you expanded the DOF then the pattern from the fronds would have been more eye-catching and exploitative of the beautiful sunlight.</td>', 'Great lighting and composition, but the DOF is a bit too narrow. I find it a bit taxing focally. Had you expanded the DOF then the pattern from the fronds would have been more eye-catching and exploitative of the beautiful sunlight.', '2003-12-01 09:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(499916, 48592, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good avoidance of the nasty soft filter treatments!<br/> <br/>Nice focus and fairly good composition, but it may have been improved by off-setting the face further left and creating some nice clean space to the right. The background does look a little messy.</td>', 'Good avoidance of the nasty soft filter treatments! Nice focus and fairly good composition, but it may have been improved by off-setting the face further left and creating some nice clean space to the right. The background does look a little messy.', '2003-12-01 09:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(499923, 49102, 6912, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and simple composition, attractive to the eye! Great lighting 10</td>', 'Wonderful and simple composition, attractive to the eye! Great lighting 10', '2003-12-01 09:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(499924, 49082, 6912, '<td valign="top">Just amazing! Great soft colors and smooth atmosphere of the photo show real softenss. Love it. 10</td>', 'Just amazing! Great soft colors and smooth atmosphere of the photo show real softenss. Love it. 10', '2003-12-01 09:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(499925, 49090, 8860, '<td valign="top">This shot frustates me!  ; )<br/> <br/>It''s a great scene, perfect focus and on-challenge - but that photographer ruins it!! It makes you conscious that this photo is being taken instead of being a distant observer.<br/> <br/>This could have been a real star of the show (and may well be in the end) but I feel that this person was added to help your title pun more than its composition. Just look at it without - its serene and unspoilt. Even someone just standing, hands in pockets - or sitting at the end would have been better.<br/> <br/>You still get top marks for technicality and take on the challenge though.</td>', 'This shot frustates me!  ; ) It''s a great scene, perfect focus and on-challenge - but that photographer ruins it!! It makes you conscious that this photo is being taken instead of being a distant observer. This could have been a real star of the show (and may well be in the end) but I feel that this person was added to help your title pun more than its composition. Just look at it without - its serene and unspoilt. Even someone just standing, hands in pockets - or sitting at the end would have been better. You still get top marks for technicality and take on the challenge though.', '2003-12-01 09:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(499926, 49089, 6912, '<td valign="top">Great choice of bw, lovely looking dog, softness of the focus shows the realxed atmosphere. 10</td>', 'Great choice of bw, lovely looking dog, softness of the focus shows the realxed atmosphere. 10', '2003-12-01 09:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(499927, 49080, 6912, '<td valign="top">clevert idea, cool lighting, 10</td>', 'clevert idea, cool lighting, 10', '2003-12-01 09:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
