(499944, 48465, 9411, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract study. took me a minute to tumbe to what this is. Is the green cast due to resampling? That is the only thing I find distracting. Well done. 9</td>', 'Nice abstract study. took me a minute to tumbe to what this is. Is the green cast due to resampling? That is the only thing I find distracting. Well done. 9', '2003-12-01 10:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
