(499948, 48631, 6008, '<td valign="top">Well the numbers do have a softness to them, as well as a slight blur. They''re not exactly in the middle so that''s good. There are a few people out there that appreciate this kind of photography, but it just doesnt really grab me. Stylistic but it holds no interest for me overall, sorry.</td>', 'Well the numbers do have a softness to them, as well as a slight blur. They''re not exactly in the middle so that''s good. There are a few people out there that appreciate this kind of photography, but it just doesnt really grab me. Stylistic but it holds no interest for me overall, sorry.', '2003-12-01 10:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(499950, 48730, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait. I love her expression. I think she must be a woman to respect.<br/>A little too bright in the foreground but still an excellent shot. 8</td>', 'Very nice portrait. I love her expression. I think she must be a woman to respect.A little too bright in the foreground but still an excellent shot. 8', '2003-12-01 10:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(499952, 49082, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Excellent colour.  8</td>', 'Very nice. Excellent colour.  8', '2003-12-01 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(499958, 49131, 6008, '<td valign="top">Composition is good and I even like the muted colors. The top of the stamen (?) even looks like it''s slightly in focus. I''m almost tempted to say it is a little too soft but I think it works to make an interesting image. The placement of the flower/petal and the shape it makes with the background is really what stands out. Had you used the same soft focus effect with a different composition I dont think it would be as strong. I''ve grown to like it.</td>', 'Composition is good and I even like the muted colors. The top of the stamen (?) even looks like it''s slightly in focus. I''m almost tempted to say it is a little too soft but I think it works to make an interesting image. The placement of the flower/petal and the shape it makes with the background is really what stands out. Had you used the same soft focus effect with a different composition I dont think it would be as strong. I''ve grown to like it.', '2003-12-01 10:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(499962, 49161, 6008, '<td valign="top">The flagpole not being in the center is a good thing. The car on the left and those in the parking lot on the right gives it a bit of a snapshot feel. The horizon is also notably tilted, possibly due to a perspective problem. I also dont really see any deliberate soft focus to create a mood. Working on different perspectives and angles and being aware of what''s in the background can be helpful to composition.</td>', 'The flagpole not being in the center is a good thing. The car on the left and those in the parking lot on the right gives it a bit of a snapshot feel. The horizon is also notably tilted, possibly due to a perspective problem. I also dont really see any deliberate soft focus to create a mood. Working on different perspectives and angles and being aware of what''s in the background can be helpful to composition.', '2003-12-01 10:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(499967, 49094, 327, '<td valign="top">I''d say you really achieved soft focus here with good detail and color. I think the eye color could be boosted a bit, but other then that I think this is very nicely done.<br/>Good luck in the challenge.8</td>', 'I''d say you really achieved soft focus here with good detail and color. I think the eye color could be boosted a bit, but other then that I think this is very nicely done.Good luck in the challenge.8', '2003-12-01 10:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(499970, 49130, 327, '<td valign="top">That is so pretty. I don''t get out at night very much but would like to try something like this. I think your colors, light and crop are all very good. Nice job.</td>', 'That is so pretty. I don''t get out at night very much but would like to try something like this. I think your colors, light and crop are all very good. Nice job.', '2003-12-01 10:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(499971, 49012, 327, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and color. Wish his paw wasn''t cut off there on the left. :( Other then that....I like this very much. It''s very good. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great lighting and color. Wish his paw wasn''t cut off there on the left. :( Other then that....I like this very much. It''s very good. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-12-01 10:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(499974, 49128, 327, '<td valign="top">Challenge met....very nicely done. I think I''d of switched the girls. The one on the left with the dark hair is a bit lost in shadow and could use some more light on her face. The girl on the right is lit perfectly. I also would of cut the crop on the bottom a little to remove the leg (s). Minor points, this is really nice. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Challenge met....very nicely done. I think I''d of switched the girls. The one on the left with the dark hair is a bit lost in shadow and could use some more light on her face. The girl on the right is lit perfectly. I also would of cut the crop on the bottom a little to remove the leg (s). Minor points, this is really nice. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-12-01 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(499982, 49181, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like the effect and its use here, but I''m not sure about the placement of the rings, they might look better closer together or maybe an element is missing, like a yearbook or something.</td>', 'I like the effect and its use here, but I''m not sure about the placement of the rings, they might look better closer together or maybe an element is missing, like a yearbook or something.', '2003-12-01 10:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(499985, 49089, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautifully shot. Great capture of a doggie expression..eyes are great. Like this one very much. It''s all good.9</td>', 'Beautifully shot. Great capture of a doggie expression..eyes are great. Like this one very much. It''s all good.9', '2003-12-01 10:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(499987, 48955, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great colors. I don''t like that moms head it cropped so tight. Other then that this is very nice. The light is spectacular.</td>', 'Nice shot, great colors. I don''t like that moms head it cropped so tight. Other then that this is very nice. The light is spectacular.', '2003-12-01 10:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(499988, 49041, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject and use of soft focus, but I wish there were a bit more contrast in the flower. Still, I think this is one of the better images in this challenge</td>', 'Nice choice of subject and use of soft focus, but I wish there were a bit more contrast in the flower. Still, I think this is one of the better images in this challenge', '2003-12-01 10:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(499989, 49178, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The light is a little strong on the left and there is a distracting blob on the wall. Other then that this is really a good portrait shot. Colors are super.</td>', 'Nice shot. The light is a little strong on the left and there is a distracting blob on the wall. Other then that this is really a good portrait shot. Colors are super.', '2003-12-01 10:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(499990, 48766, 1368, '<td valign="top">What a perfect picture! Beautiful lightning! - 10</td>', 'What a perfect picture! Beautiful lightning! - 10', '2003-12-01 10:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(499991, 49103, 327, '<td valign="top">Artistic. Good color, good composition and lighting. Good luck in the challenge. 8</td>', 'Artistic. Good color, good composition and lighting. Good luck in the challenge. 8', '2003-12-01 10:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(499992, 49107, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Looks like HDTV!!!!! Really is pretty. 10</td>', 'Stunning. Looks like HDTV!!!!! Really is pretty. 10', '2003-12-01 10:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(499993, 49195, 327, '<td valign="top">The light on her nose looks a bit unusual and not very natural.  Other then that a pretty shot of a pretty lady. Love the white fuzzy sweater.</td>', 'The light on her nose looks a bit unusual and not very natural.  Other then that a pretty shot of a pretty lady. Love the white fuzzy sweater.', '2003-12-01 10:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(499996, 49110, 10686, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand the relation between the 3 elements here, but it must be something I''m not privy to, so, no penalty for my lack of understanding.  Regardless of their relationship, I think the placement of them in the frame is awkward and distracting. The angle for the portrait is not very flattering either, we''re kind of looking up his nose.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand the relation between the 3 elements here, but it must be something I''m not privy to, so, no penalty for my lack of understanding.  Regardless of their relationship, I think the placement of them in the frame is awkward and distracting. The angle for the portrait is not very flattering either, we''re kind of looking up his nose.', '2003-12-01 10:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(499997, 49164, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a nice overall shot, which I like,  but there are a couple of things that seem a bit off. Firstly, the line above the cowboy doesn''t seem horizontal which kind of throws things off a bit, even if it IS actually straight. The other thing is that there are some weird vertical lines in the sky, which look like paper that has gotten damp, if you know what I mean? They spoil the smoothness of it for me. I''m also not 100% sure that it fits my personal definition of ''soft focus'' as it all seems pretty sharp to me, but I''ll give you (like many of the other photos) the benefit of the doubt. Still, very nice photo, 7.</td>', 'This is a nice overall shot, which I like,  but there are a couple of things that seem a bit off. Firstly, the line above the cowboy doesn''t seem horizontal which kind of throws things off a bit, even if it IS actually straight. The other thing is that there are some weird vertical lines in the sky, which look like paper that has gotten damp, if you know what I mean? They spoil the smoothness of it for me. I''m also not 100% sure that it fits my personal definition of ''soft focus'' as it all seems pretty sharp to me, but I''ll give you (like many of the other photos) the benefit of the doubt. Still, very nice photo, 7.', '2003-12-01 10:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(500001, 49164, 7086, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot but not one which says soft focus to me. This may be due to the limited display size and resolution, I would like to see it as a 30 x 20 print, or to the fact that any hard edges, the softening of which, to me, make the soft focus effect are absent.</td>', 'An interesting shot but not one which says soft focus to me. This may be due to the limited display size and resolution, I would like to see it as a 30 x 20 print, or to the fact that any hard edges, the softening of which, to me, make the soft focus effect are absent.', '2003-12-01 10:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(500008, 49080, 11843, '<td valign="top">Seems a little more out of focus than soft focus</td>', 'Seems a little more out of focus than soft focus', '2003-12-01 11:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(500009, 49082, 6624, '<td valign="top">This image works very well for me.  It''s magical, soft, and could certainly hang on any wall - child or adult.  9</td>', 'This image works very well for me.  It''s magical, soft, and could certainly hang on any wall - child or adult.  9', '2003-12-01 11:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(500010, 48584, 11843, '<td valign="top">Awwwww, how sweet! (:<br/>A little too soft for me.</td>', 'Awwwww, how sweet! (:A little too soft for me.', '2003-12-01 11:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(500011, 48788, 11843, '<td valign="top">There is a difference between soft focus and DOF...I don''t really see soft focus here.</td>', 'There is a difference between soft focus and DOF...I don''t really see soft focus here.', '2003-12-01 11:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(500012, 49194, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great colours in the sky. I would like this more if you could get closer to the church, and get lower on the ground, so that the horizon line wasnt so close to the top of the building, but nice shot anyway. 7</td>', 'Great colours in the sky. I would like this more if you could get closer to the church, and get lower on the ground, so that the horizon line wasnt so close to the top of the building, but nice shot anyway. 7', '2003-12-01 11:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(500015, 49103, 6624, '<td valign="top">Very nice original response to challenge and interesting composition. Good textures, and color...</td>', 'Very nice original response to challenge and interesting composition. Good textures, and color...', '2003-12-01 11:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(500016, 49089, 11843, '<td valign="top">Awwwww, look at those eyes! (:<br/>Nice!</td>', 'Awwwww, look at those eyes! (:Nice!', '2003-12-01 11:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(500018, 49089, 6624, '<td valign="top">I am sure that the anti pet brigade will be out in full force but for this viewer your image meets the challenge, is lovely (and soft) and very expressive</td>', 'I am sure that the anti pet brigade will be out in full force but for this viewer your image meets the challenge, is lovely (and soft) and very expressive', '2003-12-01 11:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(500019, 49126, 11843, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is one of those fiber optic light plants? There is a difference between soft focus and blur, and I''m seeing more blur.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is one of those fiber optic light plants? There is a difference between soft focus and blur, and I''m seeing more blur.', '2003-12-01 11:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(500020, 49143, 6624, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a wild color combination.  I am just making the preliminary look at all images so I will come back to this but I had to comment on the freckles, the hair, and the pink. Outrageous.  <br/>Now I am back, having looked at all and mostly given final votes.  This holds up well for me 8</td>', 'Wow, what a wild color combination.  I am just making the preliminary look at all images so I will come back to this but I had to comment on the freckles, the hair, and the pink. Outrageous.  Now I am back, having looked at all and mostly given final votes.  This holds up well for me 8', '2003-12-01 11:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(500021, 49197, 11843, '<td valign="top">Nice,,,,but a little dark I think. Nice soft focus.</td>', 'Nice,,,,but a little dark I think. Nice soft focus.', '2003-12-01 11:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(500022, 48856, 11843, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus!</td>', 'Nice soft focus!', '2003-12-01 11:13:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(500024, 49011, 11843, '<td valign="top">Beauty! Good composition, a little too soft for my taste.</td>', 'Beauty! Good composition, a little too soft for my taste.', '2003-12-01 11:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(500030, 48765, 6008, '<td valign="top">Think you went a little overboard with the soft focus and unfortunately this just looks very blurry. Composition is good, the red is fairly vibrant, and the reflection on the apple is minimum (which I found to be the hardest part of photographing apples). There is a little browness of the apple flesh, and I''ve found putting a little lemon juice on the exposed areas can lessen the time it takes for the apple to brown. The image is ok, it just looks like a very heavy fog is distorting the view.</td>', 'Think you went a little overboard with the soft focus and unfortunately this just looks very blurry. Composition is good, the red is fairly vibrant, and the reflection on the apple is minimum (which I found to be the hardest part of photographing apples). There is a little browness of the apple flesh, and I''ve found putting a little lemon juice on the exposed areas can lessen the time it takes for the apple to brown. The image is ok, it just looks like a very heavy fog is distorting the view.', '2003-12-01 11:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(500035, 48515, 656, '<td valign="top">I like the incongruity of the subject matter, given the soft focus effect used.  The tonal range is excellent, throwing all of the focus on the well exposed spikes.  The duotone dark green is effective in furthering this too and the lines and flow is subtle and interesting.  I love the soft glow to the spines.</td>', 'I like the incongruity of the subject matter, given the soft focus effect used.  The tonal range is excellent, throwing all of the focus on the well exposed spikes.  The duotone dark green is effective in furthering this too and the lines and flow is subtle and interesting.  I love the soft glow to the spines.', '2003-12-01 11:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(500037, 48894, 6008, '<td valign="top">This looks very much like a painting. First thing I noticed was actually the table and how it looks like such an odd perspective. The tones of the pitcher are wonderful and have a brushed look. The highlights really make it stand out, it has a very low key look if it wasnt for the whiteness of the flowers and table. They add a nice amount of color/tone and their softness sets the mood nicely. I also like the slightly off center look, which can be difficult in a mostly vertical shot. Very well done.</td>', 'This looks very much like a painting. First thing I noticed was actually the table and how it looks like such an odd perspective. The tones of the pitcher are wonderful and have a brushed look. The highlights really make it stand out, it has a very low key look if it wasnt for the whiteness of the flowers and table. They add a nice amount of color/tone and their softness sets the mood nicely. I also like the slightly off center look, which can be difficult in a mostly vertical shot. Very well done.', '2003-12-01 11:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(500038, 49102, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I like the angle at which you have the flower coming from the corner. The petals are bright yet soft and with the slight droop sets up a very fragile mood. I like that the green stem is darker and does not overpower or distract from the wonderful flowerhead. A classic style and look, i like it.</td>', 'Very pretty. I like the angle at which you have the flower coming from the corner. The petals are bright yet soft and with the slight droop sets up a very fragile mood. I like that the green stem is darker and does not overpower or distract from the wonderful flowerhead. A classic style and look, i like it.', '2003-12-01 11:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(500042, 48515, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and good.</td>', 'Nice idea and good.', '2003-12-01 11:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(500043, 49117, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this cat.</td>', 'I like this cat.', '2003-12-01 11:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(500044, 49193, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract. It almost looks like micro organisms under a microscope. The lighting on the weed(s) is good, giving it a nice halo effect. The light also gives it a good soft look/feel too. I''m tempted to say it needs a little more contrast, but I think you''d lose the layering if you did that. The overall image seems a little overexposed, but it''s good for an abstract.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract. It almost looks like micro organisms under a microscope. The lighting on the weed(s) is good, giving it a nice halo effect. The light also gives it a good soft look/feel too. I''m tempted to say it needs a little more contrast, but I think you''d lose the layering if you did that. The overall image seems a little overexposed, but it''s good for an abstract.', '2003-12-01 11:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(500045, 49196, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice and I like it.</td>', 'Very nice and I like it.', '2003-12-01 11:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(500046, 49082, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2003-12-01 11:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(500047, 49108, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very good and soft.</td>', 'Very good and soft.', '2003-12-01 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(500048, 49082, 2333, '<td valign="top">You nailed the soft focus, but lost some color &amp; contrast in the process.<br/>If you adjust the white point &amp; gamma this photo really scores.<br/>Great mood, appropriate for the soft focus.</td>', 'You nailed the soft focus, but lost some color & contrast in the process.If you adjust the white point & gamma this photo really scores.Great mood, appropriate for the soft focus.', '2003-12-01 11:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(500049, 49118, 772, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I draw a significant line between what is soft focus and what is out of focus.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I draw a significant line between what is soft focus and what is out of focus.', '2003-12-01 11:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(500051, 48909, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene... i love the way fog gives you the soft effect... great work :)</td>', 'Beautiful scene... i love the way fog gives you the soft effect... great work :)', '2003-12-01 11:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(500052, 49195, 12661, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice effect, but the excessive brightness on the nose pulls to much attention to itself.</td>', 'It''s a very nice effect, but the excessive brightness on the nose pulls to much attention to itself.', '2003-12-01 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(500054, 48955, 6624, '<td valign="top">This is a very sweet image, trusting and loving. The lighting, colors, and contrats (both in age and in texture) are also very pleasing.</td>', 'This is a very sweet image, trusting and loving. The lighting, colors, and contrats (both in age and in texture) are also very pleasing.', '2003-12-01 11:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(500055, 49128, 6624, '<td valign="top">I wish that the ''sister'' on the left were just a little better defined.  On the right you have the personality and expression of the youngster but on the viewer''s left it gets lost a bit.  Life is opbviously a bit more complex for her and it would be nice to bring it out.  Lovely young women.</td>', 'I wish that the ''sister'' on the left were just a little better defined.  On the right you have the personality and expression of the youngster but on the viewer''s left it gets lost a bit.  Life is opbviously a bit more complex for her and it would be nice to bring it out.  Lovely young women.', '2003-12-01 11:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(500056, 48921, 12661, '<td valign="top">There is to much light on the left of the photo which is masking the model''s right arm.</td>', 'There is to much light on the left of the photo which is masking the model''s right arm.', '2003-12-01 11:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(500059, 48968, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely</td>', 'Lovely', '2003-12-01 11:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(500062, 48816, 6130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2003-12-01 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(500063, 49094, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very good and beutiful cat.</td>', 'Very good and beutiful cat.', '2003-12-01 11:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(500069, 49155, 14593, '<td valign="top">great photo.....the softness is nice.</td>', 'great photo.....the softness is nice.', '2003-12-01 12:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(500070, 48592, 14593, '<td valign="top">so many great ideas here....I like this</td>', 'so many great ideas here....I like this', '2003-12-01 12:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(500071, 48765, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like the vibrant color popping through the softness</td>', 'I like the vibrant color popping through the softness', '2003-12-01 12:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(500073, 49101, 14593, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, and the softness</td>', 'I love the colors, and the softness', '2003-12-01 12:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(500075, 49105, 14593, '<td valign="top">I really like this....it is very soft....only a muffled glimpse of the subject, but it is clear in the delivery....the colors are vibrant too.</td>', 'I really like this....it is very soft....only a muffled glimpse of the subject, but it is clear in the delivery....the colors are vibrant too.', '2003-12-01 12:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(500079, 49014, 14593, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting photograph to me.....I find it artistic and pleasing.  This frozen state does lend itself to a softness which surprises me because I often associate ice with a stark unsoft state.....so, I really like this photo.</td>', 'this is an interesting photograph to me.....I find it artistic and pleasing.  This frozen state does lend itself to a softness which surprises me because I often associate ice with a stark unsoft state.....so, I really like this photo.', '2003-12-01 12:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(500083, 49082, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like this photo....I want to read the details later and see the technique you used..I would like to believe in elves, and I''m sure this is where you could find them!</td>', 'I like this photo....I want to read the details later and see the technique you used..I would like to believe in elves, and I''m sure this is where you could find them!', '2003-12-01 12:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(500086, 49011, 14593, '<td valign="top">very soft and pretty....love the colors</td>', 'very soft and pretty....love the colors', '2003-12-01 12:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(500087, 48766, 6624, '<td valign="top">christmas cactus I think...there is a bit too much light on top of bloom and a bit more needed elsewhere, interesting composition and idea</td>', 'christmas cactus I think...there is a bit too much light on top of bloom and a bit more needed elsewhere, interesting composition and idea', '2003-12-01 12:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(500089, 49197, 6624, '<td valign="top">the ribbon on the boxes needs to be brought out more and it feels overall too dark rather than emphasizing the boxes in the middle of "soft"</td>', 'the ribbon on the boxes needs to be brought out more and it feels overall too dark rather than emphasizing the boxes in the middle of "soft"', '2003-12-01 12:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(500090, 48945, 14593, '<td valign="top">This is a lot like the photo I entered.....flowers make nice subjects.....very soft with nice vibrant colors...</td>', 'This is a lot like the photo I entered.....flowers make nice subjects.....very soft with nice vibrant colors...', '2003-12-01 12:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(500091, 49018, 14593, '<td valign="top">This photo didn''t look soft in the thumbnail to me.....yet, on further investigation I find it is very soft....the colors are muted and the feel is nice....I like it!</td>', 'This photo didn''t look soft in the thumbnail to me.....yet, on further investigation I find it is very soft....the colors are muted and the feel is nice....I like it!', '2003-12-01 12:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(500093, 49038, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is fogged enough to meet the soft focus challenge but for this viewer it goes too far in that direction.  The expression seems manufactured and reflections in the eyes are distracting.</td>', 'this is fogged enough to meet the soft focus challenge but for this viewer it goes too far in that direction.  The expression seems manufactured and reflections in the eyes are distracting.', '2003-12-01 12:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(500095, 48592, 6624, '<td valign="top">Your title is fun.  This seems to me to epitomize what it means in the challenge rules...the soft surround to bring out the subject - in this case the (lovely) eye.</td>', 'Your title is fun.  This seems to me to epitomize what it means in the challenge rules...the soft surround to bring out the subject - in this case the (lovely) eye.', '2003-12-01 12:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(500097, 48856, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice photo....there is a softness to be found even in what appears to be a " hard" detailed subject matter!</td>', 'nice photo....there is a softness to be found even in what appears to be a " hard" detailed subject matter!', '2003-12-01 12:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(500098, 48803, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice photo....I like the colors....the muting effect.....and, I like the framing and composition....it is pleasing to my eye!</td>', 'nice photo....I like the colors....the muting effect.....and, I like the framing and composition....it is pleasing to my eye!', '2003-12-01 12:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(500100, 48503, 14593, '<td valign="top">I can identify with this subject matter....I like this idea.....gets your point across nicely....good photo too!</td>', 'I can identify with this subject matter....I like this idea.....gets your point across nicely....good photo too!', '2003-12-01 12:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(500125, 49038, 13498, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo expression, but the soft focus is way overdone.. detail mixed with soft focus makes it nice..</td>', 'This is a great photo expression, but the soft focus is way overdone.. detail mixed with soft focus makes it nice..', '2003-12-01 13:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(500128, 49026, 12061, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors, looks very nice. excellent soft focus</td>', 'wonderful colors, looks very nice. excellent soft focus', '2003-12-01 13:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(500130, 49014, 12061, '<td valign="top">This has to be one of my favourites of the challenge. I love the colors, they work so well together. The soft focus on this ice looks amazing, what a GREAT shot!</td>', 'This has to be one of my favourites of the challenge. I love the colors, they work so well together. The soft focus on this ice looks amazing, what a GREAT shot!', '2003-12-01 13:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(500132, 49107, 5391, '<td valign="top">Holy cow.  Possibly THE most beautiful sunset I''ve ever seen.  The detail in the clouds is amazing, and the soft focus adds a fluid feeling that greatly enhances the photo.</td>', 'Holy cow.  Possibly THE most beautiful sunset I''ve ever seen.  The detail in the clouds is amazing, and the soft focus adds a fluid feeling that greatly enhances the photo.', '2003-12-01 13:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(500133, 49001, 5391, '<td valign="top">Looks like a ribbon-winner to me.  Perfect.  10</td>', 'Looks like a ribbon-winner to me.  Perfect.  10', '2003-12-01 13:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(500135, 49014, 5391, '<td valign="top">Stunning work of fine art.  I''m amazed at some of the creativity in this challenge.  Soft focus used very effectively and the dramatic colors are gorgeous.  10</td>', 'Stunning work of fine art.  I''m amazed at some of the creativity in this challenge.  Soft focus used very effectively and the dramatic colors are gorgeous.  10', '2003-12-01 13:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(500138, 49063, 5391, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous night shot.  Beautiful work.  The only thing that detracts is the bit of a hot spot on the church, but other than that, your exposure is just beautiful.  8</td>', 'Gorgeous night shot.  Beautiful work.  The only thing that detracts is the bit of a hot spot on the church, but other than that, your exposure is just beautiful.  8', '2003-12-01 13:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(500141, 48455, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of soft focus - this challenge is just one beautiful entry after another!  I love your choice of subject and the arrangement - it''s greatly complimented by the challenge theme.  8</td>', 'Excellent use of soft focus - this challenge is just one beautiful entry after another!  I love your choice of subject and the arrangement - it''s greatly complimented by the challenge theme.  8', '2003-12-01 13:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(500142, 49196, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  Very nicely enhanced by the soft focus.  I can see this on a calendar.  8</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  Very nicely enhanced by the soft focus.  I can see this on a calendar.  8', '2003-12-01 13:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(500144, 49039, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  You''ve captured "soft focus" very well.</td>', 'Beautiful.  You''ve captured "soft focus" very well.', '2003-12-01 13:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(500146, 48845, 6008, '<td valign="top">The subject choice is good for a soft focus shot. There is softness but the lack of contrast in the shot is not really helping create much of a mood. The stuffed animals are also a little too close to the back cloth, which makes the background become more in focus and in the shot than just being a solid color in the background. The colors seem slightly muted and overall the image seems a little too light, playing with the brightness/contrast levels probably would have helped some.</td>', 'The subject choice is good for a soft focus shot. There is softness but the lack of contrast in the shot is not really helping create much of a mood. The stuffed animals are also a little too close to the back cloth, which makes the background become more in focus and in the shot than just being a solid color in the background. The colors seem slightly muted and overall the image seems a little too light, playing with the brightness/contrast levels probably would have helped some.', '2003-12-01 13:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(500149, 49126, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming this was taken in low light so as to emphasize the fibre optics. The low light setting has caused the image to be slightly blurry rather than soft focus, at least near the top. The lower flower/leaf is much better and I like the pinpoints of light there too. The composition seems chaotic, so much has been cropped out that other than the lower leaf/flower there isnt much of a main subject. I think isolating the lower leaf/flower by getting in a lot closer would have made for a much more dramatic photograph.</td>', 'I''m assuming this was taken in low light so as to emphasize the fibre optics. The low light setting has caused the image to be slightly blurry rather than soft focus, at least near the top. The lower flower/leaf is much better and I like the pinpoints of light there too. The composition seems chaotic, so much has been cropped out that other than the lower leaf/flower there isnt much of a main subject. I think isolating the lower leaf/flower by getting in a lot closer would have made for a much more dramatic photograph.', '2003-12-01 13:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(500151, 48801, 327, '<td valign="top">Not much to say...just good luck in the challenge and this is really a nice job. 8</td>', 'Not much to say...just good luck in the challenge and this is really a nice job. 8', '2003-12-01 13:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(500156, 49033, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is the class of the field for this challenge. This image is perfect.</td>', 'This is the class of the field for this challenge. This image is perfect.', '2003-12-01 13:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(500160, 49138, 6008, '<td valign="top">This doesnt look like it uses the full 640 pixels width and so seems a little small - getting it as big as is allowed can really help with the fine details. Most of the wine bottle to the right is dark for me, obscuring most of the label so much so that I find myself squinting to try and see what it says, which distracts from the flowers. They are soft, which is good, and partly I like how they are brightly illuminated, but I also partly think they are just a tad overexposed. I also wish I could see more details in the petals, but that is mostly due to the size as I mentioned earlier.</td>', 'This doesnt look like it uses the full 640 pixels width and so seems a little small - getting it as big as is allowed can really help with the fine details. Most of the wine bottle to the right is dark for me, obscuring most of the label so much so that I find myself squinting to try and see what it says, which distracts from the flowers. They are soft, which is good, and partly I like how they are brightly illuminated, but I also partly think they are just a tad overexposed. I also wish I could see more details in the petals, but that is mostly due to the size as I mentioned earlier.', '2003-12-01 13:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(500169, 48955, 6008, '<td valign="top">The soft focus is good without going over the top, it sets up a nice atmosphere and mood, which is also helped by the golden light coming from behing them. The only things I dont really care for are things that can not be controlled in such a candid shot like this, such as the pacficier/dummy and the either cropped out hand or the uncropped finger. It''s good to see that your choice of subject CAN be something more than just a snapshot. Nice image.</td>', 'The soft focus is good without going over the top, it sets up a nice atmosphere and mood, which is also helped by the golden light coming from behing them. The only things I dont really care for are things that can not be controlled in such a candid shot like this, such as the pacficier/dummy and the either cropped out hand or the uncropped finger. It''s good to see that your choice of subject CAN be something more than just a snapshot. Nice image.', '2003-12-01 13:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(500178, 49121, 6008, '<td valign="top">Hrm, I''m not sure about this one. In some ways I like it, in others I dont. First thing I dont like is the black corner in the lower left - it ruins the flow and I dont see the need to have it there, but I can also see how you couldnt crop it either. It looks like a set-up studio shot so a reshoot could have been done. The two bands of colors - the yellowish white and the purplish white - I''m really not sure what purpose that serves. I kinda like it in a ''that''s different'' way, but on the other hand it looks like a white balance problem. Had the entire image been the yellowish white then it could have been an almost ''high-key'' shot in that the subject blended into the background but could still be seen - camouflage of sorts. The connection with the title is cute, but that also makes it seem like the soft focus and egg is for humor rather than mood, but I suppose humor is a mood too. It''s not horrid, but it''s different for sure.</td>', 'Hrm, I''m not sure about this one. In some ways I like it, in others I dont. First thing I dont like is the black corner in the lower left - it ruins the flow and I dont see the need to have it there, but I can also see how you couldnt crop it either. It looks like a set-up studio shot so a reshoot could have been done. The two bands of colors - the yellowish white and the purplish white - I''m really not sure what purpose that serves. I kinda like it in a ''that''s different'' way, but on the other hand it looks like a white balance problem. Had the entire image been the yellowish white then it could have been an almost ''high-key'' shot in that the subject blended into the background but could still be seen - camouflage of sorts. The connection with the title is cute, but that also makes it seem like the soft focus and egg is for humor rather than mood, but I suppose humor is a mood too. It''s not horrid, but it''s different for sure.', '2003-12-01 14:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(500188, 48885, 14593, '<td valign="top">beautiful.....soft.....muted colors......</td>', 'beautiful.....soft.....muted colors......', '2003-12-01 14:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(500191, 49172, 6008, '<td valign="top">The sun seems to dominate this a little too much to the point I find myself looking at that rather than the birds. The fact that you have three of the birds cropped out also leaves me feeling a little incomplete. And the horizon is also a little tilted. I do like the glow in the wings of the birds on the right - the warm color is great.</td>', 'The sun seems to dominate this a little too much to the point I find myself looking at that rather than the birds. The fact that you have three of the birds cropped out also leaves me feeling a little incomplete. And the horizon is also a little tilted. I do like the glow in the wings of the birds on the right - the warm color is great.', '2003-12-01 14:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(500198, 49134, 14593, '<td valign="top">interesting subjects in this photo.....they intrique.</td>', 'interesting subjects in this photo.....they intrique.', '2003-12-01 14:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(500201, 48631, 14593, '<td valign="top">it does fit the category......I''m sure my clock looked like this many times to me</td>', 'it does fit the category......I''m sure my clock looked like this many times to me', '2003-12-01 14:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(500204, 48465, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like this....it is soft and suggestive.......I think?  haha!</td>', 'I like this....it is soft and suggestive.......I think?  haha!', '2003-12-01 14:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(500205, 48705, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice....soft....flattering potrait</td>', 'nice....soft....flattering potrait', '2003-12-01 14:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(500206, 49123, 6008, '<td valign="top">The top part of the rose petals are good, they are lit well, slightly soft and delicate. It looks like you probably only used one light source on this, coming from the top left. Because of this the stem and leaves are darker and as such slightly blurry/OOF or far more soft focus and has some noise. The foreground petal also shows a shadow, which is a little distracting. Softly lighting it from the lower right as well as the upper left may have helped with the foreground petals and leaves. There is also a strip of green in the lower right corner that''s a little distracting too. Compositionally it''s ok, it''s in a classic center position, but for a more dramatic image you could try playing around with different angles.</td>', 'The top part of the rose petals are good, they are lit well, slightly soft and delicate. It looks like you probably only used one light source on this, coming from the top left. Because of this the stem and leaves are darker and as such slightly blurry/OOF or far more soft focus and has some noise. The foreground petal also shows a shadow, which is a little distracting. Softly lighting it from the lower right as well as the upper left may have helped with the foreground petals and leaves. There is also a strip of green in the lower right corner that''s a little distracting too. Compositionally it''s ok, it''s in a classic center position, but for a more dramatic image you could try playing around with different angles.', '2003-12-01 14:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(500207, 49138, 14593, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear the soft music.....nice photo</td>', 'I can almost hear the soft music.....nice photo', '2003-12-01 14:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(500211, 49107, 14593, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.....from the thumbnail I was almost thinking this photo does not look soft....but, first impressions can be wrong.  Upon seeing the full image it is soft and muted....</td>', 'This is very nice.....from the thumbnail I was almost thinking this photo does not look soft....but, first impressions can be wrong.  Upon seeing the full image it is soft and muted....', '2003-12-01 14:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(500217, 49089, 14593, '<td valign="top">what a sweet soft face.....</td>', 'what a sweet soft face.....', '2003-12-01 14:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(500219, 49012, 14593, '<td valign="top">what a softie.....love the soft focus and the muted colors</td>', 'what a softie.....love the soft focus and the muted colors', '2003-12-01 14:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
