(500511, 49001, 8860, '<td valign="top">A supreme image, expertly taken. Great composition, perfect use of the media and challenge brief - simply sumptuous. Your ribbon will be much deserved.<br/> <br/>1 point off for the slightly thinner border on the left!  ; )</td>', 'A supreme image, expertly taken. Great composition, perfect use of the media and challenge brief - simply sumptuous. Your ribbon will be much deserved. 1 point off for the slightly thinner border on the left!  ; )', '2003-12-01 18:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(500517, 49082, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very unusual looking image. Artistic in its colours and appropriately using the challenge to present a scene of beauty which is enhanced by the technique.<br/> <br/>You may have used a coloured filter (smeared liquids, painted acetate?) to achieve this - I''ll be interested to know.<br/> <br/>Marked down only for the distracting hilights in the background.</td>', 'Very unusual looking image. Artistic in its colours and appropriately using the challenge to present a scene of beauty which is enhanced by the technique. You may have used a coloured filter (smeared liquids, painted acetate?) to achieve this - I''ll be interested to know. Marked down only for the distracting hilights in the background.', '2003-12-01 18:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
