(500545, 49165, 6405, '<td valign="top">It looks like a weird flower on busy and noisy background,I see no artistic quality here :-(</td>', 'It looks like a weird flower on busy and noisy background,I see no artistic quality here :-(', '2003-12-01 18:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(500546, 49103, 6405, '<td valign="top">No soft focus here,colors are washed away and white distracting noise added,4 from me !</td>', 'No soft focus here,colors are washed away and white distracting noise added,4 from me !', '2003-12-01 18:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(500547, 49143, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is a charming, eye-catching shot.  First of all you couldn''t get a better model.  Next the combination of that pink fuzzy hood and that beautiful hair is super!  The soft focus is just right - not blurred, but glowing.  Wish the back of the hood were in the picture too feels cut off - or crop out all of the background, just have the pink framing her face?  8</td>', 'This is a charming, eye-catching shot.  First of all you couldn''t get a better model.  Next the combination of that pink fuzzy hood and that beautiful hair is super!  The soft focus is just right - not blurred, but glowing.  Wish the back of the hood were in the picture too feels cut off - or crop out all of the background, just have the pink framing her face?  8', '2003-12-01 18:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(500548, 49138, 6405, '<td valign="top">(flower ?) if it is got overexposed on spots ,composition is not very interesting one and softening is over done !</td>', '(flower ?) if it is got overexposed on spots ,composition is not very interesting one and softening is over done !', '2003-12-01 18:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(500550, 49001, 7628, '<td valign="top">lovely title, lovely subject.  The soft focus gives us a feel both for the texture and the scent of the rose, but at the same time it is abstract enough just to enjoy the shapes and color.  The composition is nice with the center of the flower at the "thirds" line. 9</td>', 'lovely title, lovely subject.  The soft focus gives us a feel both for the texture and the scent of the rose, but at the same time it is abstract enough just to enjoy the shapes and color.  The composition is nice with the center of the flower at the "thirds" line. 9', '2003-12-01 18:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(500551, 49172, 7485, '<td valign="top">I''ll ignore the obvious lack of soft focus, since you''ll undoubtedly get lots of comments on that. The two birds are so interesting that you may want to focus the attention on them by cropping out some of the others. Personally, I''d get rid of all but the three closest to the sun, but there are other less drastic options too. Also, straighen that horizon! Finally, after the challenge, a bit of spot-editing to remove the glare would be worth while. This has the makings of a fabulous photo!</td>', 'I''ll ignore the obvious lack of soft focus, since you''ll undoubtedly get lots of comments on that. The two birds are so interesting that you may want to focus the attention on them by cropping out some of the others. Personally, I''d get rid of all but the three closest to the sun, but there are other less drastic options too. Also, straighen that horizon! Finally, after the challenge, a bit of spot-editing to remove the glare would be worth while. This has the makings of a fabulous photo!', '2003-12-01 18:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(500553, 49178, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice softening job,eyes preserved sharpness,color balance little over on red side,8 from me!</td>', 'Nice softening job,eyes preserved sharpness,color balance little over on red side,8 from me!', '2003-12-01 18:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(500554, 48758, 7628, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea.  I''m more struck my the shallow depth of focus than the soft focus.  The sax is so out of range it is hard to tell what it is.  I don;t feel a connection between the music and the sax. Maybe to have the instrument lying on top of the music, the white of the page could give a nice glow using soft focus...</td>', 'An interesting idea.  I''m more struck my the shallow depth of focus than the soft focus.  The sax is so out of range it is hard to tell what it is.  I don;t feel a connection between the music and the sax. Maybe to have the instrument lying on top of the music, the white of the page could give a nice glow using soft focus...', '2003-12-01 18:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(500556, 48799, 7628, '<td valign="top">love those eyes!  The light is beautiful, the soft focus works well to show the feeling of the photographer for the subject, and the warmth of the boy himself. The background is distracting - could you try cropping most of it out?  The part I''d most like to loose is the bright sunlight  - too bad thats really not an area you can crop.</td>', 'love those eyes!  The light is beautiful, the soft focus works well to show the feeling of the photographer for the subject, and the warmth of the boy himself. The background is distracting - could you try cropping most of it out?  The part I''d most like to loose is the bright sunlight  - too bad thats really not an area you can crop.', '2003-12-01 18:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(500557, 49012, 6405, '<td valign="top">This is more a blur portrait than soft focus,edges are not preserved and eyes are too dark! Background has too many things going on (books ,furniture),4 from me and next time will be better! :-)</td>', 'This is more a blur portrait than soft focus,edges are not preserved and eyes are too dark! Background has too many things going on (books ,furniture),4 from me and next time will be better! :-)', '2003-12-01 18:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(500559, 49121, 6405, '<td valign="top">Interesting soft effect,7 from me!</td>', 'Interesting soft effect,7 from me!', '2003-12-01 18:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(500560, 48801, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice edge preserved soft focus,subject too centered,nice light,7 from me!</td>', 'Nice edge preserved soft focus,subject too centered,nice light,7 from me!', '2003-12-01 18:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(500561, 48465, 7485, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for simple abstract shots, and it doesn''t get any better than this: just four simple shapes, yet the subject is immediatly obvious. The soft focus and B&amp;W helps the abstraction, and the ever so slightly asymmetric lighting adds interest. 10</td>', 'I''m a sucker for simple abstract shots, and it doesn''t get any better than this: just four simple shapes, yet the subject is immediatly obvious. The soft focus and B&W helps the abstraction, and the ever so slightly asymmetric lighting adds interest. 10', '2003-12-01 18:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(500562, 49105, 6405, '<td valign="top">I was thinking you got Alexander the Great Mosaic here,LOL,8 from me!</td>', 'I was thinking you got Alexander the Great Mosaic here,LOL,8 from me!', '2003-12-01 18:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(500563, 48584, 7628, '<td valign="top">A dreamy girl is a good subject for a soft focus.  I like the flowered background - would have like just that - and not the dark purple pillow too, althoughit does put her head at a nice angle.  Wish there was a bit more light on her face - I feel I can see her sholfder better than her face right now.  And I think the focus is a bit too soft..</td>', 'A dreamy girl is a good subject for a soft focus.  I like the flowered background - would have like just that - and not the dark purple pillow too, althoughit does put her head at a nice angle.  Wish there was a bit more light on her face - I feel I can see her sholfder better than her face right now.  And I think the focus is a bit too soft..', '2003-12-01 18:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(500567, 49197, 7628, '<td valign="top">I''d love to get this present.  I like the gold stripes - though could be brought out better with more light, and the soft focus would make them glow apealingly.  A spot of light on the top where the bow is would top it off nicely.This really is too dark.</td>', 'I''d love to get this present.  I like the gold stripes - though could be brought out better with more light, and the soft focus would make them glow apealingly.  A spot of light on the top where the bow is would top it off nicely.This really is too dark.', '2003-12-01 18:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(500568, 49035, 7628, '<td valign="top">Woah.  This looks like a scene out of a movie with special effects.  I assume this is a sculpture, those are funky reflections.  Wish both front feet were in the frame and the dragon had a bit more room around him, would give more of a feeling he was about to take off.  I''f afraid your attempt at soft focus just looks too much like out of focus.</td>', 'Woah.  This looks like a scene out of a movie with special effects.  I assume this is a sculpture, those are funky reflections.  Wish both front feet were in the frame and the dragon had a bit more room around him, would give more of a feeling he was about to take off.  I''f afraid your attempt at soft focus just looks too much like out of focus.', '2003-12-01 18:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(500572, 49076, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great subject, good title.  very nice soft beams of light.  I''d crop a bit on the bottom and bring th land on the left closer if not touching the bottom edge.  It gives those light beams (and your eyes) a solid destination and somehow feels better to me.</td>', 'Great subject, good title.  very nice soft beams of light.  I''d crop a bit on the bottom and bring th land on the left closer if not touching the bottom edge.  It gives those light beams (and your eyes) a solid destination and somehow feels better to me.', '2003-12-01 19:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(500574, 48432, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, never knew Bocce was so action filled.  I like the effect of the soft focus on the bold sunlight - very heroic feel, vibrant, suggets action without bluring.  I don''t like the dark spots in the corners tho''</td>', 'Very dramatic, never knew Bocce was so action filled.  I like the effect of the soft focus on the bold sunlight - very heroic feel, vibrant, suggets action without bluring.  I don''t like the dark spots in the corners tho''', '2003-12-01 19:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(500575, 49102, 7628, '<td valign="top">lovely!  great light, perfect soft focus effect.  Precise composition, great color.  10</td>', 'lovely!  great light, perfect soft focus effect.  Precise composition, great color.  10', '2003-12-01 19:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(500576, 48705, 7628, '<td valign="top">great expression, great soft focus effect. I like how she is leaning on her arms - nice dark sweater with a sublte lined texture.  All this works very well.  but ACK!  those white pieces of paper behind, distracting.  this would be so lovely without them - just a solid white or black or some subtle background! 7</td>', 'great expression, great soft focus effect. I like how she is leaning on her arms - nice dark sweater with a sublte lined texture.  All this works very well.  but ACK!  those white pieces of paper behind, distracting.  this would be so lovely without them - just a solid white or black or some subtle background! 7', '2003-12-01 19:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(500577, 49041, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice yellow.  It would be more interesting cropped with less balance  or more - make the center really off center or exactly on center.  If the lighting were less intense you''d get better shapes and shadows.</td>', 'Nice yellow.  It would be more interesting cropped with less balance  or more - make the center really off center or exactly on center.  If the lighting were less intense you''d get better shapes and shadows.', '2003-12-01 19:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(500590, 49033, 3306, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. Just a beautiful shot. Looks like a Christmas greeting card. 10</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. Just a beautiful shot. Looks like a Christmas greeting card. 10', '2003-12-01 19:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(500593, 49088, 6405, '<td valign="top">Interesting artistic effect,only distraction is the overexposed top part of the flower,6 from me!</td>', 'Interesting artistic effect,only distraction is the overexposed top part of the flower,6 from me!', '2003-12-01 19:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(500594, 49117, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and sharp eyes,7 from me!</td>', 'Nice composition and sharp eyes,7 from me!', '2003-12-01 19:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(500603, 49105, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is not true "soft focus" but a great, creative capture and should place high in the challenge. Congrats on a fine picture.</td>', 'This is not true "soft focus" but a great, creative capture and should place high in the challenge. Congrats on a fine picture.', '2003-12-01 19:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(500604, 49102, 5792, '<td valign="top">This classic soft focus image is wonderful. Black background works well and the framing is fantastic.  Lighting is superb.</td>', 'This classic soft focus image is wonderful. Black background works well and the framing is fantastic.  Lighting is superb.', '2003-12-01 19:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(500606, 49026, 5792, '<td valign="top">The mark of a great photographer is to take the ordinary and make it look extraordinary. You have accomplished this in this image. Great shot.</td>', 'The mark of a great photographer is to take the ordinary and make it look extraordinary. You have accomplished this in this image. Great shot.', '2003-12-01 20:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
