(500624, 48487, 5792, '<td valign="top">I admit, a gun is not the first thing I think of for a "soft focus" challenge. :) I don''t think it is soft focused either, but it is a super shot and should score well. Those pesky "purists" might disagree. Dang them!</td>', 'I admit, a gun is not the first thing I think of for a "soft focus" challenge. :) I don''t think it is soft focused either, but it is a super shot and should score well. Those pesky "purists" might disagree. Dang them!', '2003-12-01 20:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(500630, 49076, 5792, '<td valign="top">An excellent choice for this challenge. If you could have used a soft focus filter on this one it would have been even better. It would have been better that electronic soft focus filtering could not be applied for this challenge.</td>', 'An excellent choice for this challenge. If you could have used a soft focus filter on this one it would have been even better. It would have been better that electronic soft focus filtering could not be applied for this challenge.', '2003-12-01 20:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(500632, 49030, 5792, '<td valign="top">Just a touch to light for me, but a very nicely composed image.</td>', 'Just a touch to light for me, but a very nicely composed image.', '2003-12-01 20:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(500633, 48801, 5792, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this image.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this image.', '2003-12-01 20:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(500635, 49143, 5792, '<td valign="top">Not bad in lavender either! You have done a terrific job capturing your subject.</td>', 'Not bad in lavender either! You have done a terrific job capturing your subject.', '2003-12-01 20:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(500639, 48705, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a great candid portraiture. These dimensions might be hard to fit a standard frame, but it is worthy of display.</td>', 'This is a great candid portraiture. These dimensions might be hard to fit a standard frame, but it is worthy of display.', '2003-12-01 20:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(500646, 49001, 5792, '<td valign="top">There are not enough superlatives to adequately describe this image. This is true \"soft focus\".  Most, like mine, are not. I suspect many folks do not know what soft focus is.<br/> <br/>But beyond that... Lighting is perfect. Use of the ROT is perfect. DOF is perfect. Title is perfect. In short... perfect.</td>', 'There are not enough superlatives to adequately describe this image. This is true \"soft focus\".  Most, like mine, are not. I suspect many folks do not know what soft focus is. But beyond that... Lighting is perfect. Use of the ROT is perfect. DOF is perfect. Title is perfect. In short... perfect.', '2003-12-01 20:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(500655, 49172, 5792, '<td valign="top">Although this is not soft focused in any way it is a superb sunset picture. The way you have captured the sun surrounded by birds is stunning. Also getting the lighting on the sun correct while maintaining lighting and detail on the birds is commendable. <br/> <br/>The only flaw is that the ocean is not level and fixing that, unfortunately, would screw up the framing of the birds at the edge of the image.</td>', 'Although this is not soft focused in any way it is a superb sunset picture. The way you have captured the sun surrounded by birds is stunning. Also getting the lighting on the sun correct while maintaining lighting and detail on the birds is commendable.  The only flaw is that the ocean is not level and fixing that, unfortunately, would screw up the framing of the birds at the edge of the image.', '2003-12-01 20:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(500662, 49195, 5792, '<td valign="top">Your concept and subject in this portraiture is good. It may be to "soft". You might want to show more detail of your beautiful model. The bright lighting on the nose does not do justice to her in this image.</td>', 'Your concept and subject in this portraiture is good. It may be to "soft". You might want to show more detail of your beautiful model. The bright lighting on the nose does not do justice to her in this image.', '2003-12-01 20:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(500665, 49133, 5792, '<td valign="top">The softness of this image is good. The horses grazing is a great subject for soft focus. <br/> <br/>However, the noise in it destroys the mood. There is a DPC legal program called NeatImage that removes image noise that I think would dramatically improve this shot. The fense in the foreground may be taking up a bit to much real estate in the image and it would be nice to see all the legs of the horse on the right.<br/></td>', 'The softness of this image is good. The horses grazing is a great subject for soft focus.  However, the noise in it destroys the mood. There is a DPC legal program called NeatImage that removes image noise that I think would dramatically improve this shot. The fense in the foreground may be taking up a bit to much real estate in the image and it would be nice to see all the legs of the horse on the right.', '2003-12-01 21:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(500667, 49082, 10686, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, Dreamy colors</td>', 'Beautiful, Dreamy colors', '2003-12-01 21:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(500669, 48705, 10686, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait, nice subtle diffusion, lovely skin tone and red hair</td>', 'Wonderful portrait, nice subtle diffusion, lovely skin tone and red hair', '2003-12-01 21:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(500670, 49128, 5792, '<td valign="top">A good studio image with nice expressions on your subjects. This image would be improved if the girl on the left had the same lighting on her as the girl on the right. They are both of equal importance in this image.</td>', 'A good studio image with nice expressions on your subjects. This image would be improved if the girl on the left had the same lighting on her as the girl on the right. They are both of equal importance in this image.', '2003-12-01 21:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
