(500886, 48921, 2553, '<td valign="top">The title is a little confusing (though that has no effect on your score1).  Is she at the doorway expecting her mother, or is she an expectant mother??  Well, no matter - I love the look of this beautiful black and white. The composition is wonderful - the right side "fades to black" and the left side highlights are kind of "blown out" so that the details fade into nothingness, and all of this works together to give the shot good balance, as well as a sense of mystery - (where is she, what is she thinking, why is she dressed in a formal looking dress??)  This shot is intriguing in many respects, and I find it very visually appealing.  My only regret with it - that there isn''t a little bit more light on her face. 9</td>', 'The title is a little confusing (though that has no effect on your score1).  Is she at the doorway expecting her mother, or is she an expectant mother??  Well, no matter - I love the look of this beautiful black and white. The composition is wonderful - the right side "fades to black" and the left side highlights are kind of "blown out" so that the details fade into nothingness, and all of this works together to give the shot good balance, as well as a sense of mystery - (where is she, what is she thinking, why is she dressed in a formal looking dress??)  This shot is intriguing in many respects, and I find it very visually appealing.  My only regret with it - that there isn''t a little bit more light on her face. 9', '2003-12-02 05:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(500888, 48815, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, it makes me think of the travel posters at the travel agent''s office.  Wonderful color and composition, and I love the soft focus look.8</td>', 'Beautiful shot, it makes me think of the travel posters at the travel agent''s office.  Wonderful color and composition, and I love the soft focus look.8', '2003-12-02 05:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(500889, 49107, 2553, '<td valign="top">Looks like a shot from Arizona Highways magazine!  What absolutely gorgeous color!   A very visually engaging shot. 8</td>', 'Looks like a shot from Arizona Highways magazine!  What absolutely gorgeous color!   A very visually engaging shot. 8', '2003-12-02 05:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(500890, 49164, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the shot, the sepia tone, the composition.  Visually interesting.  It doesn''t really seem to be "soft focus", but I guess it does have an overall kind of soft "feel" to it.  8</td>', 'I love the shot, the sepia tone, the composition.  Visually interesting.  It doesn''t really seem to be "soft focus", but I guess it does have an overall kind of soft "feel" to it.  8', '2003-12-02 05:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(500891, 49011, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very visually appealing shot.  I find the choice of background color to be somewhat unusual, and a little surprising, but it does work well.  Composition is effective, the soft focus beautiful.  Has an almost sensuous feel to it.  8</td>', 'Very visually appealing shot.  I find the choice of background color to be somewhat unusual, and a little surprising, but it does work well.  Composition is effective, the soft focus beautiful.  Has an almost sensuous feel to it.  8', '2003-12-02 05:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(500896, 49038, 11769, '<td valign="top">A wonderful soft felling to this photo. The model has a thoughtful introspective look that is very attractive. This one is without doubt one of my favorites. Beautiful! 10</td>', 'A wonderful soft felling to this photo. The model has a thoughtful introspective look that is very attractive. This one is without doubt one of my favorites. Beautiful! 10', '2003-12-02 05:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(500909, 49107, 7543, '<td valign="top">There is a bit of what looks like over sharpening (before blurring...), best seen on the cactus to the left (white lines on the outlines). Looks like youi have oversharpened the image and then blurred it. Colors are great and the subjects are great as well. I think you should have skipped the sharpening, everything else is great.</td>', 'There is a bit of what looks like over sharpening (before blurring...), best seen on the cactus to the left (white lines on the outlines). Looks like youi have oversharpened the image and then blurred it. Colors are great and the subjects are great as well. I think you should have skipped the sharpening, everything else is great.', '2003-12-02 06:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
