(501231, 48816, 11843, '<td valign="top">I love Akita''s! Had one myself. He passed away of old age a few years back. Best, Smartest dog I ever had. <br/>Good composition and colors.<br/>There is a difference between DOF and soft focus and it looks like I''m going to have to subtract a point for that.</td>', 'I love Akita''s! Had one myself. He passed away of old age a few years back. Best, Smartest dog I ever had. Good composition and colors.There is a difference between DOF and soft focus and it looks like I''m going to have to subtract a point for that.', '2003-12-02 13:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(501233, 49118, 11843, '<td valign="top">DOF and Soft focus are two different things! Were you serious with this one???? Sorry, not sure I would have submitted this.</td>', 'DOF and Soft focus are two different things! Were you serious with this one???? Sorry, not sure I would have submitted this.', '2003-12-02 13:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
