(501245, 49121, 11843, '<td valign="top">Works as an abstract! The bottom left corner is a little on the dark side. If you could have carried the pastel colors all the way through, I would have scored higher. Good composition. Nice soft focus.</td>', 'Works as an abstract! The bottom left corner is a little on the dark side. If you could have carried the pastel colors all the way through, I would have scored higher. Good composition. Nice soft focus.', '2003-12-02 13:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
