(501419, 49082, 10510, '<td valign="top">Is this place real?  I want to walk through these woods and look for elves.  Very mystical.  10</td>', 'Is this place real?  I want to walk through these woods and look for elves.  Very mystical.  10', '2003-12-02 19:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
