(501450, 49129, 772, '<td valign="top">This feels more out of focus than soft focused.  I like the theme and composition tho.</td>', 'This feels more out of focus than soft focused.  I like the theme and composition tho.', '2003-12-02 19:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
