(501584, 48631, 14012, '<td valign="top">would have looked better off-set a little more, so it was on the 1/3 line. Looks more like a camera shake at a long exposure, than a soft-focus shot. Sorry.</td>', 'would have looked better off-set a little more, so it was on the 1/3 line. Looks more like a camera shake at a long exposure, than a soft-focus shot. Sorry.', '2003-12-02 22:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(501587, 49090, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. It looks like the pier is hanging out in thin air. Ilike the composition, it being in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. It looks like the pier is hanging out in thin air. Ilike the composition, it being in B&W.', '2003-12-02 22:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(501590, 49033, 11769, '<td valign="top">What a great memory to save. Soft focus is perfect. Can''t imagine it being better.</td>', 'What a great memory to save. Soft focus is perfect. Can''t imagine it being better.', '2003-12-02 22:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(501602, 48815, 14012, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it cropped a bit differently so there was more sky and less water. Nice photo though. Starting at 7</td>', 'I would have liked it cropped a bit differently so there was more sky and less water. Nice photo though. Starting at 7', '2003-12-02 22:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(501603, 48766, 11769, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a picture on a poster for a movie.  The alien flower from the Darkness or some such. HA!:)  It is beautiful. Very much a feeling of presence. More than what it is, sort of religious in nature. I love this picture!10+<br/>PS Hope I didnt offend.<br/></td>', 'Reminds me of a picture on a poster for a movie.  The alien flower from the Darkness or some such. HA!:)  It is beautiful. Very much a feeling of presence. More than what it is, sort of religious in nature. I love this picture!10+PS Hope I didnt offend.', '2003-12-02 22:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(501604, 49118, 14012, '<td valign="top">seems out of focus</td>', 'seems out of focus', '2003-12-02 22:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(501607, 49102, 11769, '<td valign="top">Just another flower pic. So tiring.<br/>What did I just say? Sorry wrong picture. This one is unbelievable! Fantastic! And what a perfect flower it is. 10<br/>      In the  top 3 I''ll bet.<br/></td>', 'Just another flower pic. So tiring.What did I just say? Sorry wrong picture. This one is unbelievable! Fantastic! And what a perfect flower it is. 10      In the  top 3 I''ll bet.', '2003-12-02 22:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
