(502867, 49107, 13247, '<td valign="top">sorry im asking so many questions. i looked in the rules and i didnt c my answer so ill ask you. do all of the challenges have a time limit on the pics taken? do they all have to be in that week?<br/> <br/>P.S. i thought ur pic was great</td>', 'sorry im asking so many questions. i looked in the rules and i didnt c my answer so ill ask you. do all of the challenges have a time limit on the pics taken? do they all have to be in that week? P.S. i thought ur pic was great', '2003-12-03 18:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(502932, 49128, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the pose in this photo.  The lighting doesn''t work well for me... I''m not really sure why... it feels cold maybe... maybe somewhat contradictory with ''soft focus'' in my own interpretation of it.. your soft focus is excellent though :)</td>', 'I like the pose in this photo.  The lighting doesn''t work well for me... I''m not really sure why... it feels cold maybe... maybe somewhat contradictory with ''soft focus'' in my own interpretation of it.. your soft focus is excellent though :)', '2003-12-03 20:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(502934, 49193, 772, '<td valign="top">lovely photo... very nice work.  the title needs some help possibly :)</td>', 'lovely photo... very nice work.  the title needs some help possibly :)', '2003-12-03 20:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(502935, 48432, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the warmth of the light in this image...</td>', 'I like the warmth of the light in this image...', '2003-12-03 20:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(502984, 49033, 9256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! That captures motion, childhood, and innocence all in one. The window barrier is distracting though, it''d be 2x better if it was just a white background. But hey, life isn''t that convenient ;)</td>', 'Beautiful! That captures motion, childhood, and innocence all in one. The window barrier is distracting though, it''d be 2x better if it was just a white background. But hey, life isn''t that convenient ;)', '2003-12-03 21:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(503040, 49033, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very well done...beautiful work.  Might have cropped a little more on top and right.</td>', 'Very well done...beautiful work.  Might have cropped a little more on top and right.', '2003-12-03 21:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(503052, 49110, 9906, '<td valign="top">I can handle the person in the shot (though I like the building better by itself), but the branch on the right is way distracting.  It looks unreal.  Did you use an on board flash?  Also the church is a touch tilted in frame.  Otherwise a very nice shot!<br/>TC</td>', 'I can handle the person in the shot (though I like the building better by itself), but the branch on the right is way distracting.  It looks unreal.  Did you use an on board flash?  Also the church is a touch tilted in frame.  Otherwise a very nice shot!TC', '2003-12-03 22:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(503056, 49033, 9906, '<td valign="top">I\''m sorry, but the only thing I can think of to say right now is this shot is brilliant!<br/>TC</td>', 'I\''m sorry, but the only thing I can think of to say right now is this shot is brilliant!TC', '2003-12-03 22:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(503113, 48515, 4007, '<td valign="top">The colors and shapes here are intersting, and the soft focus does seem to add to the shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'The colors and shapes here are intersting, and the soft focus does seem to add to the shot.  Nice work.', '2003-12-03 23:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(503116, 49089, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not one to generally enjoy pet photos, but this is very well captured and uses soft focus wonderfully.  Good choice of depth of field as well.</td>', 'I''m not one to generally enjoy pet photos, but this is very well captured and uses soft focus wonderfully.  Good choice of depth of field as well.', '2003-12-03 23:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(503134, 49110, 4007, '<td valign="top">This composition doesn''t really work for me.  The different elements don''t really seem to fit together.  Whatever story it is trying to tell (since there does seem to be one) just isn''t getting through very well at all.  Also, I don''t think there was any reason for soft focus in this shot, as it doesn''t seem to fit.</td>', 'This composition doesn''t really work for me.  The different elements don''t really seem to fit together.  Whatever story it is trying to tell (since there does seem to be one) just isn''t getting through very well at all.  Also, I don''t think there was any reason for soft focus in this shot, as it doesn''t seem to fit.', '2003-12-03 23:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(503138, 49026, 4007, '<td valign="top">I do like the idea here.  Soft focus does a good job of bleeding bright lights and colors into other areas of a shot, and it was worth using that to your advantage.  The colors are somewhat interesting but the shot is still lacking anything that really draws my attention, so my eyes just wander around the clutter mostly indead of feeling like there''s something here drawing me in.  A worthy effort though.  Good luck.</td>', 'I do like the idea here.  Soft focus does a good job of bleeding bright lights and colors into other areas of a shot, and it was worth using that to your advantage.  The colors are somewhat interesting but the shot is still lacking anything that really draws my attention, so my eyes just wander around the clutter mostly indead of feeling like there''s something here drawing me in.  A worthy effort though.  Good luck.', '2003-12-03 23:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(503144, 48487, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure exactly what concept you were after here.  The soft focus works pretty well with the low contrast.  I guess the idea might have been using traditional means of a romantic or "beautiful" shot (i.e. the flowing white background) in contrast with the subject of a handgun, but all in all this shot leaves me cold.  It''s maybe a little too straightforward and consequently not especially interesing to me.  Nicely executed though. 7</td>', 'I''m not quite sure exactly what concept you were after here.  The soft focus works pretty well with the low contrast.  I guess the idea might have been using traditional means of a romantic or "beautiful" shot (i.e. the flowing white background) in contrast with the subject of a handgun, but all in all this shot leaves me cold.  It''s maybe a little too straightforward and consequently not especially interesing to me.  Nicely executed though. 7', '2003-12-03 23:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(503147, 48955, 4007, '<td valign="top">the finger sneaking in on the right side and the cutting off of just the top of her hair on top are elements that might be able to be improved.</td>', 'the finger sneaking in on the right side and the cutting off of just the top of her hair on top are elements that might be able to be improved.', '2003-12-03 23:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(503148, 49197, 4007, '<td valign="top">This needs better lighting.  Also, it doesn''t seem to be soft focus, moreso it seems to just be out of focus.  Work on your setup and technical photography skills with this and it''ll come out much better. (and probably get it down with a sharp focus before you mess with soft focus on it)</td>', 'This needs better lighting.  Also, it doesn''t seem to be soft focus, moreso it seems to just be out of focus.  Work on your setup and technical photography skills with this and it''ll come out much better. (and probably get it down with a sharp focus before you mess with soft focus on it)', '2003-12-03 23:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(503151, 49080, 4007, '<td valign="top">well, I''m guessing the blurryness is supposed to simulate drunken vision, since otherwise this is way too soft/out of focus.  The clean backdrop and subject placement work well enough, although I think I''d try pushing the subject a little more to the corner and going a little wider in order to work with the negative space a little more.  This might work for an ad or something, but as a stand alone shot is doesn''t really hold my attention much.  Not a bad try though.</td>', 'well, I''m guessing the blurryness is supposed to simulate drunken vision, since otherwise this is way too soft/out of focus.  The clean backdrop and subject placement work well enough, although I think I''d try pushing the subject a little more to the corner and going a little wider in order to work with the negative space a little more.  This might work for an ad or something, but as a stand alone shot is doesn''t really hold my attention much.  Not a bad try though.', '2003-12-03 23:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(503153, 49014, 4007, '<td valign="top">Well, I like the color bleeding that the soft focus produces here, but I with all the fine detail available here I find myself squinting in hopes of all the little bubbles in the ice coming into focus.  I guess I''m just torn.</td>', 'Well, I like the color bleeding that the soft focus produces here, but I with all the fine detail available here I find myself squinting in hopes of all the little bubbles in the ice coming into focus.  I guess I''m just torn.', '2003-12-03 23:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
