(504612, 49155, 2764, '<td valign="top">oooohhh..my favorite so far! Maybe mute the skin color a little so it doesn''t compete with the lovely spun gold of the hair??? red attracts the eye more than yellow so even though the photo is perfectly balance compositionally the pink of the skin carrries more weight than it should. maybe. 9</td>', 'oooohhh..my favorite so far! Maybe mute the skin color a little so it doesn''t compete with the lovely spun gold of the hair??? red attracts the eye more than yellow so even though the photo is perfectly balance compositionally the pink of the skin carrries more weight than it should. maybe. 9', '2003-12-05 12:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
