(504630, 48631, 2764, '<td valign="top">yes- my clock looks like that in the morning too.  It should read 5:59 though to give the sensation that this is waaay to early to be waking up.  Not a bad image, really - it tells a great story.</td>', 'yes- my clock looks like that in the morning too.  It should read 5:59 though to give the sensation that this is waaay to early to be waking up.  Not a bad image, really - it tells a great story.', '2003-12-05 12:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(504643, 49038, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is lovely - however the fabric at the neck lloks like a hand grabbing her throat at first glance - see how it looks like craggy old fingers?  If you could change the color of that fabric post challenge you will have a stunning portrait.</td>', 'This is lovely - however the fabric at the neck lloks like a hand grabbing her throat at first glance - see how it looks like craggy old fingers?  If you could change the color of that fabric post challenge you will have a stunning portrait.', '2003-12-05 13:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(504655, 48945, 2764, '<td valign="top">Wow - and orange is a color that you seldom see in photographs.  10</td>', 'Wow - and orange is a color that you seldom see in photographs.  10', '2003-12-05 13:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(504693, 48919, 2764, '<td valign="top">ummmm I love these soft focus images that look like oil paintings - lovely</td>', 'ummmm I love these soft focus images that look like oil paintings - lovely', '2003-12-05 13:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(504842, 49001, 5475, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far in the challenge. 10 from me!  Well done.<br/>JD</td>', 'My favorite so far in the challenge. 10 from me!  Well done.JD', '2003-12-05 16:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(504845, 49039, 5475, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  One of the best in the challenge.  10 from me!<br/>JD</td>', 'Very nice.  One of the best in the challenge.  10 from me!JD', '2003-12-05 16:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(504847, 49018, 5475, '<td valign="top">Excellent work!  This shot is very simplistic in nature, but has lots and lots of appeal!.  Great colors and shapes, and the soft focus works fantastic with this subject.  10 from me!<br/>JD</td>', 'Excellent work!  This shot is very simplistic in nature, but has lots and lots of appeal!.  Great colors and shapes, and the soft focus works fantastic with this subject.  10 from me!JD', '2003-12-05 16:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(504894, 49141, 6097, '<td valign="top">Awesome Photo.  Great use of soft focus.  I didn''t do a good job of achieving soft focus but IMO you got it just right.  I predict this to be in top 3 and get a ribbon.  Love the colors.  Looks like a perfect photo for a Christmas card to me.  Good luck!!!</td>', 'Awesome Photo.  Great use of soft focus.  I didn''t do a good job of achieving soft focus but IMO you got it just right.  I predict this to be in top 3 and get a ribbon.  Love the colors.  Looks like a perfect photo for a Christmas card to me.  Good luck!!!', '2003-12-05 17:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(504993, 49001, 10702, '<td valign="top">Brilliant ! A perfect ten.<br/> <br/>later added: You wont believe how often I''ve came back just to look at it, really beutiful !</td>', 'Brilliant ! A perfect ten. later added: You wont believe how often I''ve came back just to look at it, really beutiful !', '2003-12-05 20:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(504994, 48631, 6999, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is a great photo - but it''s a great entry for this challenge. Hope you score that high, though I suspect you won''t. Placement of the figures in the frame shows thought too - good stuff.</td>', 'I don''t think this is a great photo - but it''s a great entry for this challenge. Hope you score that high, though I suspect you won''t. Placement of the figures in the frame shows thought too - good stuff.', '2003-12-05 20:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(504995, 48455, 6999, '<td valign="top">Er ... didn''t I comment on this already? Oh yeah - in that other challenge. I think it works better here, though the lamp is still annoying - I think perhaps it would work as a framing element better - if you shot more under the angle of the glass of it: to me it''s intrusive now. The set-up works well for the challenge other than that, and it is genuinely soft focus, which is rare enough.</td>', 'Er ... didn''t I comment on this already? Oh yeah - in that other challenge. I think it works better here, though the lamp is still annoying - I think perhaps it would work as a framing element better - if you shot more under the angle of the glass of it: to me it''s intrusive now. The set-up works well for the challenge other than that, and it is genuinely soft focus, which is rare enough.', '2003-12-05 20:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(505213, 49094, 3306, '<td valign="top">Although not really soft focus, I like the title and the picture is good. Well done.</td>', 'Although not really soft focus, I like the title and the picture is good. Well done.', '2003-12-06 08:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(505214, 49181, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like how you made the centers of the rings appear sharp and the rest of the image slightly out of focus. I would be interested in knowing your technique for doing this without the use of Photoshop.</td>', 'I like how you made the centers of the rings appear sharp and the rest of the image slightly out of focus. I would be interested in knowing your technique for doing this without the use of Photoshop.', '2003-12-06 08:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(505216, 49142, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very nice  portrait but it looks Out of Focus as opposed to a Soft Focus. Nicely balanced and the flowers in the forground give the picture depth. I like it.</td>', 'Very nice  portrait but it looks Out of Focus as opposed to a Soft Focus. Nicely balanced and the flowers in the forground give the picture depth. I like it.', '2003-12-06 08:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(505366, 48503, 11895, '<td valign="top">creative soft focus but this would have been better in color</td>', 'creative soft focus but this would have been better in color', '2003-12-06 13:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
