(505642, 49121, 14715, '<td valign="top">Hard to make out, I feel a bit too soft.</td>', 'Hard to make out, I feel a bit too soft.', '2003-12-06 20:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(505655, 49011, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve composed this with the leaf curving across the bottom.  The flowers are a lovely subject for soft focus, especially with the white on them.  But this is just a bit too soft.  The pink of the flowers blends a bit too well with the background.  Something that contrasts better would work.</td>', 'I like how you''ve composed this with the leaf curving across the bottom.  The flowers are a lovely subject for soft focus, especially with the white on them.  But this is just a bit too soft.  The pink of the flowers blends a bit too well with the background.  Something that contrasts better would work.', '2003-12-06 21:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(505657, 48845, 7628, '<td valign="top">A cute subjet for the sentimental tone of soft focus.  They''d look even cuter propped on a bed with a fluffy pillow, perhaps some flowered wallpaper behind. The anonymous green sheet just doesn''t add anything.</td>', 'A cute subjet for the sentimental tone of soft focus.  They''d look even cuter propped on a bed with a fluffy pillow, perhaps some flowered wallpaper behind. The anonymous green sheet just doesn''t add anything.', '2003-12-06 21:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(505658, 49199, 7628, '<td valign="top">The soft focus has a nice effect of the christmas lights.  I like the string of beads that leads your eyes across the picture.  The santa on the left is nice, if a bit too soft, but a really wish the santa in the front was well lit - it would be a great object to focus on.</td>', 'The soft focus has a nice effect of the christmas lights.  I like the string of beads that leads your eyes across the picture.  The santa on the left is nice, if a bit too soft, but a really wish the santa in the front was well lit - it would be a great object to focus on.', '2003-12-06 21:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(505659, 49128, 7628, '<td valign="top">A lovely glow tho their faces.  I like the contract between them.  Having the light coming mostly from the right illuminates the fairer sister, and shadows the darker sister mysteriously.  I wish they were back to back, with no chairs inbetween.  The white space between the chairs is distracting.</td>', 'A lovely glow tho their faces.  I like the contract between them.  Having the light coming mostly from the right illuminates the fairer sister, and shadows the darker sister mysteriously.  I wish they were back to back, with no chairs inbetween.  The white space between the chairs is distracting.', '2003-12-06 21:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(505660, 49101, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the "snow"  I like the placement of the big round ornament at the focus of attention.  A bit of color correction on the snow would help, and perhaps a bit of cropping in.</td>', 'I like the softness of the "snow"  I like the placement of the big round ornament at the focus of attention.  A bit of color correction on the snow would help, and perhaps a bit of cropping in.', '2003-12-06 21:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(505662, 49018, 7628, '<td valign="top">The shine of the silver scoop catches the soft focus nicely, and the tumble of golden nuts works well with it too.</td>', 'The shine of the silver scoop catches the soft focus nicely, and the tumble of golden nuts works well with it too.', '2003-12-06 21:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(505663, 49142, 7628, '<td valign="top">An nice soft focus subject.  Feels a bit more out of focus not just soft.  I like your composition with the flowers framing the bottom, the screen behind.</td>', 'An nice soft focus subject.  Feels a bit more out of focus not just soft.  I like your composition with the flowers framing the bottom, the screen behind.', '2003-12-06 21:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(505666, 48503, 7628, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t call this soft focus, just a good usee of selective focus.  Very clever to have the writing on a diagonal, very interesting.  Very nice picture, well thought out, well executed, simple, and effective.</td>', 'I wouldn''t call this soft focus, just a good usee of selective focus.  Very clever to have the writing on a diagonal, very interesting.  Very nice picture, well thought out, well executed, simple, and effective.', '2003-12-06 21:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(505670, 49117, 7628, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Lovely angle, the light catches those wiskers and makes them stand out against the black fur.  I like the whote background, wish it weren''t wrinkled, but I do like the idea of something white with a pattern, or white objects behind... but no cat would go for such a set  up. 9</td>', 'Beautiful.  Lovely angle, the light catches those wiskers and makes them stand out against the black fur.  I like the whote background, wish it weren''t wrinkled, but I do like the idea of something white with a pattern, or white objects behind... but no cat would go for such a set  up. 9', '2003-12-06 21:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(505684, 49130, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo but I think too sharp for the challenge. 5</td>', 'Very nice photo but I think too sharp for the challenge. 5', '2003-12-06 22:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
