(505800, 49014, 13576, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The colors, the feelling of coldness. I think you nailed it. Great interp of soft focus. There is nothing to critique.</td>', 'Beautiful. The colors, the feelling of coldness. I think you nailed it. Great interp of soft focus. There is nothing to critique.', '2003-12-07 09:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(505802, 49178, 13576, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a bit harsh on her skin. The background is a little distracting. Overall, a good photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-12-08 08:20:22.</i></td>', 'The lighting seems a bit harsh on her skin. The background is a little distracting. Overall, a good photo.', '2003-12-07 09:22:14.000000', '2003-12-08 08:20:22.000000', 1),
(505803, 48945, 13576, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful picture. Lighting a wonderful. Well done.</td>', 'What a beautiful picture. Lighting a wonderful. Well done.', '2003-12-07 09:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(505804, 48465, 13576, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is abstract and suggestive. I like it. Very Creative. I think the only thing that may improve this is if the background where a bit darker to help the lines be more distinguished.</td>', 'Wow, this is abstract and suggestive. I like it. Very Creative. I think the only thing that may improve this is if the background where a bit darker to help the lines be more distinguished.', '2003-12-07 09:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(505805, 49181, 13576, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but, the photo is a little static. I find it kinda boring.  The black background is too gray.</td>', 'Nice concept but, the photo is a little static. I find it kinda boring.  The black background is too gray.', '2003-12-07 09:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(505806, 49102, 13576, '<td valign="top">very beautiful. The colors muted to soften the mood for this soft focus challenge. Well done.</td>', 'very beautiful. The colors muted to soften the mood for this soft focus challenge. Well done.', '2003-12-07 09:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(505807, 48909, 13576, '<td valign="top">Looks a little over sharpened. Overall, well done.</td>', 'Looks a little over sharpened. Overall, well done.', '2003-12-07 09:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(505808, 49082, 13576, '<td valign="top">I like this enchanted forest look. Really makes the imagination wonder. Well done.</td>', 'I like this enchanted forest look. Really makes the imagination wonder. Well done.', '2003-12-07 09:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(505809, 48730, 13576, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. Overall, the think her pose could have been better executed making for a more visually appealing photo.</td>', 'I like the concept. Overall, the think her pose could have been better executed making for a more visually appealing photo.', '2003-12-07 09:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(505810, 48816, 13576, '<td valign="top">Akita? Awesome dog. Great pose, right on focus for this challenge, colors are great. Looks very majestic. A great photographic interpretation of this breed.</td>', 'Akita? Awesome dog. Great pose, right on focus for this challenge, colors are great. Looks very majestic. A great photographic interpretation of this breed.', '2003-12-07 09:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(505811, 48432, 13576, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. I love the color variation here. It makes me wonder what is he doing? Bowling, Frisbee, yoga maybe? I like photos that make me think, let my mind wander. Composition and lighting are excellent.</td>', 'Interesting photo. I love the color variation here. It makes me wonder what is he doing? Bowling, Frisbee, yoga maybe? I like photos that make me think, let my mind wander. Composition and lighting are excellent.', '2003-12-07 09:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(505876, 48758, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the idea ... I think I''d have tried a taller, skinnier arrangement so only one page of the sheet music shows, or else all the way horizontally so you see the top of both pages. On my monitor, the brightest highlights on the sax don''t quite fit "the mood."</td>', 'I like the idea ... I think I''d have tried a taller, skinnier arrangement so only one page of the sheet music shows, or else all the way horizontally so you see the top of both pages. On my monitor, the brightest highlights on the sax don''t quite fit "the mood."', '2003-12-07 13:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(505885, 49143, 1031, '<td valign="top">Based on comments on my entry, I''m guessing you have some "too sharp" comments. I like it because I think you''re using color (rather than blurriness) as the "softening agent," and I like seeing people try different techniques. Cute photo too!</td>', 'Based on comments on my entry, I''m guessing you have some "too sharp" comments. I like it because I think you''re using color (rather than blurriness) as the "softening agent," and I like seeing people try different techniques. Cute photo too!', '2003-12-07 13:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(505887, 48945, 1031, '<td valign="top">The hints of other colors around the edges turn this into a complete floral still-life, not just a flower macro. I''d be tempted to run a canvas filter on it -- to me it has the look/feel of an oil painting while remaining photographic.</td>', 'The hints of other colors around the edges turn this into a complete floral still-life, not just a flower macro. I''d be tempted to run a canvas filter on it -- to me it has the look/feel of an oil painting while remaining photographic.', '2003-12-07 13:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(505890, 49105, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative use of a "filter" requiring no adapter, even for a point-and-shoot camera. Maybe a little less glare from the upper right would soften the reflections off the glass, but overall I like it.</td>', 'Interesting and creative use of a "filter" requiring no adapter, even for a point-and-shoot camera. Maybe a little less glare from the upper right would soften the reflections off the glass, but overall I like it.', '2003-12-07 13:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(505891, 49076, 1031, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture -- I usually make shots like this a bit darker and contrasty, but that''s definitely a matter of personal taste (and sometimes monitor adjustment).</td>', 'Excellent capture -- I usually make shots like this a bit darker and contrasty, but that''s definitely a matter of personal taste (and sometimes monitor adjustment).', '2003-12-07 13:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(505893, 49030, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d add more contrast, but a nice shot anyway.</td>', 'I''d add more contrast, but a nice shot anyway.', '2003-12-07 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(505894, 49103, 1031, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty good diagonal composition, with contrasts in color, texture, and shape. I think I''d put a 2-10 pixel black border on it though, I think it would tie it together better than the default gray on the DPC page.<br/> <br/>When I first saw it I thought it might be in water -- you might want to try it again in a tray, with the stones covered by a 1/4 inch or so of water.</td>', 'That''s a pretty good diagonal composition, with contrasts in color, texture, and shape. I think I''d put a 2-10 pixel black border on it though, I think it would tie it together better than the default gray on the DPC page. When I first saw it I thought it might be in water -- you might want to try it again in a tray, with the stones covered by a 1/4 inch or so of water.', '2003-12-07 14:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(505896, 49102, 1031, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting/exposure control to maintain highlight detail on all but MAYBE one petal; just sharp enough to see the detail.</td>', 'Excellent lighting/exposure control to maintain highlight detail on all but MAYBE one petal; just sharp enough to see the detail.', '2003-12-07 14:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(505898, 49161, 1031, '<td valign="top">Gee, looks like about a 15 mph breeze to me. But the setting is calm ...</td>', 'Gee, looks like about a 15 mph breeze to me. But the setting is calm ...', '2003-12-07 14:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(505899, 49082, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast range you used here -- dark enough to add some moodiness, not so dark as to be scary, enough contrast to see the details.</td>', 'I like the contrast range you used here -- dark enough to add some moodiness, not so dark as to be scary, enough contrast to see the details.', '2003-12-07 14:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(505900, 49088, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d tone down that one bright spot on the back of the top petal, but Ilike the composition, colors, and backlighting.</td>', 'I''d tone down that one bright spot on the back of the top petal, but Ilike the composition, colors, and backlighting.', '2003-12-07 14:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(505904, 48487, 1031, '<td valign="top">An image and title rife with double-entendres ...</td>', 'An image and title rife with double-entendres ...', '2003-12-07 14:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(505911, 49165, 1031, '<td valign="top">That looks remarkably like it could have been taken in my front yard. The BOP flower has so much detail, I try to avoid showing it against such a busy background. Nice color and detail on the flower itself.</td>', 'That looks remarkably like it could have been taken in my front yard. The BOP flower has so much detail, I try to avoid showing it against such a busy background. Nice color and detail on the flower itself.', '2003-12-07 14:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(505914, 48515, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts in both tone and subject.</td>', 'Nice contrasts in both tone and subject.', '2003-12-07 14:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(505918, 49195, 1031, '<td valign="top">On my monitor her nose looks a little too bright. With the extreme effect you have here, I''d want to try further experimentation, such as applying a canvas filter to make it look painted, or layering it with a picture of some nice fluffy clouds at a low opacity level.</td>', 'On my monitor her nose looks a little too bright. With the extreme effect you have here, I''d want to try further experimentation, such as applying a canvas filter to make it look painted, or layering it with a picture of some nice fluffy clouds at a low opacity level.', '2003-12-07 14:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(505920, 48909, 1031, '<td valign="top">On my monitor the sky looks a little over-exposed, but it''s a nice capture of the mist. Personally, I''d play with various Curve settings in Photoshop to see if I could bring out some sun rays, probably darkening the whole thing some.</td>', 'On my monitor the sky looks a little over-exposed, but it''s a nice capture of the mist. Personally, I''d play with various Curve settings in Photoshop to see if I could bring out some sun rays, probably darkening the whole thing some.', '2003-12-07 14:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
