(506064, 49090, 12802, '<td valign="top">There are so many shot sin this challenge that I''d like to see in focus and this is definately one of them.  Although, I''d prefer someone sitting at the bottom of the dock maybe with their legs in the still water.  Mind you, that''s got nothing much to do with this picture...<br/> <br/>I really like this, the whole image seems very soft (Apart from the green grass maybe?) However, as I said I like this, full marks from me!</td>', 'There are so many shot sin this challenge that I''d like to see in focus and this is definately one of them.  Although, I''d prefer someone sitting at the bottom of the dock maybe with their legs in the still water.  Mind you, that''s got nothing much to do with this picture... I really like this, the whole image seems very soft (Apart from the green grass maybe?) However, as I said I like this, full marks from me!', '2003-12-07 17:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(506066, 49121, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well that''s definitely soft.  It looks like you used some sort of material over the lens, but the color renditions, and especially the delineation seem too unnatural.   In the white area, the soft focus looks good, but a bit yellowish,  and some more light would have made nice soft highlights.</td>', 'Well that''s definitely soft.  It looks like you used some sort of material over the lens, but the color renditions, and especially the delineation seem too unnatural.   In the white area, the soft focus looks good, but a bit yellowish,  and some more light would have made nice soft highlights.', '2003-12-07 17:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
