(506100, 49082, 8776, '<td valign="top">This is the most beautiful picture I have ever seen!  It is so beautiful, that it almost looks fake!</td>', 'This is the most beautiful picture I have ever seen!  It is so beautiful, that it almost looks fake!', '2003-12-07 19:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(506101, 49076, 8776, '<td valign="top">What a great job catching the mist off of the water!</td>', 'What a great job catching the mist off of the water!', '2003-12-07 19:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(506102, 49030, 280, '<td valign="top">I hope you dont mind but I copied this shot in to photoshop and adjusted the contrast, this resulted in a beautiful landscape. Unfortunately here I can not make out enough detail behind the dull grey haze.</td>', 'I hope you dont mind but I copied this shot in to photoshop and adjusted the contrast, this resulted in a beautiful landscape. Unfortunately here I can not make out enough detail behind the dull grey haze.', '2003-12-07 19:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(506105, 48592, 280, '<td valign="top">The eye is too central in the shot for my liking, I would have cropped a little from the left hand side to place the eye on the left third. Also I do not believe this to be soft focus, it appears to be a shallow depth of field as the eye is "in focus".</td>', 'The eye is too central in the shot for my liking, I would have cropped a little from the left hand side to place the eye on the left third. Also I do not believe this to be soft focus, it appears to be a shallow depth of field as the eye is "in focus".', '2003-12-07 19:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(506106, 49161, 280, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to be in perfect focus to me.</td>', 'This shot seems to be in perfect focus to me.', '2003-12-07 19:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(506116, 48465, 772, '<td valign="top">nice abstract... i like the softness and the low key nature of it... nice work :)</td>', 'nice abstract... i like the softness and the low key nature of it... nice work :)', '2003-12-07 19:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(506152, 49102, 10702, '<td valign="top">Very nice, one of the best ones !</td>', 'Very nice, one of the best ones !', '2003-12-07 21:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(506158, 49138, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesitng composition.. I think it would work a little stronger with more even lighting...</td>', 'Interesitng composition.. I think it would work a little stronger with more even lighting...', '2003-12-07 21:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(506161, 49143, 6008, '<td valign="top">The mix of colors is very vibrant and colorful. Composition is good. Her expression is good, and the skin tones are nicely even. It''s usually good to have the eyes be very sharp on portraits that have been softened, although I understand how that could be difficult giving the restraints of the rules. The single strand across her cheek is a little distracting, but not overly so.</td>', 'The mix of colors is very vibrant and colorful. Composition is good. Her expression is good, and the skin tones are nicely even. It''s usually good to have the eyes be very sharp on portraits that have been softened, although I understand how that could be difficult giving the restraints of the rules. The single strand across her cheek is a little distracting, but not overly so.', '2003-12-07 21:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(506162, 49076, 6008, '<td valign="top">The colors/greens are a little muted, but the shafts of light through the trees is a classic and wonderful scene. There is a strong mood present, although I think it could do with a little more contrast to bring it out a little more.</td>', 'The colors/greens are a little muted, but the shafts of light through the trees is a classic and wonderful scene. There is a strong mood present, although I think it could do with a little more contrast to bring it out a little more.', '2003-12-07 21:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(506164, 49118, 6008, '<td valign="top">This looks more out of focus than soft focus. Not sure what you were attempting to communicate with this shot so not sure I can offer up any suggestions, sorry.</td>', 'This looks more out of focus than soft focus. Not sure what you were attempting to communicate with this shot so not sure I can offer up any suggestions, sorry.', '2003-12-07 21:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(506168, 49103, 6008, '<td valign="top">The mix of the hard pebbles and the fragile leaf is interesting. It''s fairly soft, which is good, and the colors in the pebbles are good. It seems just a tad overexposed, but the textures are good.</td>', 'The mix of the hard pebbles and the fragile leaf is interesting. It''s fairly soft, which is good, and the colors in the pebbles are good. It seems just a tad overexposed, but the textures are good.', '2003-12-07 21:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(506170, 48465, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and certainly very suggestive. The dof and tone is good, and quite creative. Good idea.</td>', 'Interesting idea and certainly very suggestive. The dof and tone is good, and quite creative. Good idea.', '2003-12-07 21:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(506171, 49154, 6008, '<td valign="top">The bird seems to be screaming out to be nice and sharp. It seems more out of focus than soft focus, but that could be because of the subject. The red is very vibrant, though, and the composition is good.</td>', 'The bird seems to be screaming out to be nice and sharp. It seems more out of focus than soft focus, but that could be because of the subject. The red is very vibrant, though, and the composition is good.', '2003-12-07 21:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(506174, 48766, 7467, '<td valign="top">It does say "peace".... very soft and subtle.</td>', 'It does say "peace".... very soft and subtle.', '2003-12-07 21:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(506176, 48945, 7467, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, love the colors.</td>', 'Beautiful, love the colors.', '2003-12-07 21:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(506177, 48631, 7467, '<td valign="top">Soft.. but not real interesting... sorry.</td>', 'Soft.. but not real interesting... sorry.', '2003-12-07 21:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(506178, 49033, 6008, '<td valign="top">Looks like a truly magical moment. The soft focus here is perfect, composition is great - like sneaking a peak at her own little private ceremony, and the lighting is wonderful. Very natural look/pose/feel. A definite christmas card look. Excellent shot.</td>', 'Looks like a truly magical moment. The soft focus here is perfect, composition is great - like sneaking a peak at her own little private ceremony, and the lighting is wonderful. Very natural look/pose/feel. A definite christmas card look. Excellent shot.', '2003-12-07 21:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(506183, 48592, 12045, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  Having the focus on just the eye is what makes it.  Great work!</td>', 'This is a great shot.  Having the focus on just the eye is what makes it.  Great work!', '2003-12-07 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(506185, 48894, 12045, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I think you will get a ribbon with this shot.</td>', 'Excellent!  I think you will get a ribbon with this shot.', '2003-12-07 22:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(506195, 49080, 4793, '<td valign="top">I like your title, good thinking, nicely composed shot.</td>', 'I like your title, good thinking, nicely composed shot.', '2003-12-07 22:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(506197, 49107, 4793, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot, I love your colors and your composition, beautiful.</td>', 'This is a stunning shot, I love your colors and your composition, beautiful.', '2003-12-07 22:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(506200, 49088, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful well composed shot.</td>', 'Beautiful well composed shot.', '2003-12-07 22:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(506201, 49089, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog, great shot, very well done.</td>', 'Beautiful dog, great shot, very well done.', '2003-12-07 22:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
